<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
Spitfire physical overlay: vector redraw from nine supplied photographs.
Whole-face reference: 683797901-2bd818c5-2893-49d1-addb-4cd510e2565e.jpg;
detail references: 683797908, 683797918 and 683797946 (same overlay).

The five cloud contours are traced; scenery and tower details are redrawn.
Flat colours omit illumination, age damage and print halftoning. Photos are
oblique and contain no active raster or scale: registration and optical
blending remain approximate. This is not an exact restoration or a scan.

Tower centre is near raw X=312. Its roof spans approximately X=292..332,
Y=184, with feet near Y=252. These keep the photographic proportions while
placing the cabin across the ROM's broad collision region (plane origins
X=280..327/Y>=181; bullet positions X=291..338/Y>=197). The printed outline
is not a collision mask. The driver and ROM determine all hits.

Backdrop plus additive monochrome video is a readability approximation;
transmission/reflectance of the original sheet and CRT brightness are unknown.
All views retain the same 4:3 raster; no gameplay coordinates are altered.
-->
<mamelayout version="2">

